# CalendAI core

- Do not rebuild from scratch. Modularize in place.
- Stack: `frontend/` React+Vite+Tailwind; `backend/` Express+Mongo. AI is OpenRouter/DeepSeek. Payments are Lemon Squeezy.
- Keep in git (required at server boot): `backend/models/Booking.js`, `OAuthHandoff.js`, `ProcessedPaymentEvent.js`.
- Do not grow `backend/server.js` or `frontend/src/App.jsx` — extract to routes/services/components.
- Mongo transactions need a replica set. Credits: `{ aiCredits: { $gte: cost } }`, fail-closed. Bookings: atomic status claim.
- Dates: ISO with `T`, `safeParseDate()`, timezone-aware. Frontend: `safeStorage` + try/catch, never storage at module scope.
- Outlook stays unimplemented-and-honest. No duplicate Mongoose User schemas in route files.
